🔹 3️⃣ Authentication (Important ⚠️)

GitHub does NOT allow passwords anymore
You must use a Personal Access Token (PAT)

4️⃣ Generate Personal Access Token
Go to GitHub → Settings
Developer Settings → Personal Access Tokens
Click Generate Token (Classic)
Select:
✅ repo
✅ workflow (optional)

👉 Copy the token (you won’t see it again)
